# Combustion Man: "Whenever Combustion Man attacks, destroy target permanent unless its controller has Combustion Man deal damage to them equal
# to his power." Any permanent is a target, a land included: Bot1 targets Bot2's Forest and Bot2, its controller, declines, so the Forest is
# destroyed and Bot2 takes nothing from the ability (4 power: the Expect checks Bot2's life before combat damage).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Combustion Man
Mox Emerald
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest x19

